### Scraper Module API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000/scraper

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/scraper
@email = INSERIRE

### ==============================================
### Start Scraping Job
### ==============================================

### Start scraping - Basic request
POST {{baseUrl}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{email}}",
    "website_url": "INSERIRE"
}

### Start scraping - With max_pages limit
POST {{baseUrl}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{email}}",
    "website_url": "https://example.com",
    "max_pages": 50
}

### Start scraping - Real website example
POST {{baseUrl}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{email}}",
    "website_url": "https://www.example.com",
    "max_pages": 100
}

### ==============================================
### Get Scraping Status
### ==============================================

### Check scraping job status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status/{{email}}

### Check status with different email
GET {{baseUrl}}/status/other@example.com

### ==============================================
### Get Collection Info
### ==============================================

### Get collection information
GET {{baseUrl}}/collection/{{email}}

### Get collection info for non-existent service
GET {{baseUrl}}/collection/unknown@example.com

### ==============================================
### Delete Collection
### ==============================================

### Delete the collection for a service
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/collection/{{email}}

### ==============================================
### Error Cases
### ==============================================

### Start scraping - Missing email
POST {{baseUrl}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "website_url": "https://example.com"
}

### Start scraping - Missing website_url
POST {{baseUrl}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{email}}"
}

### Start scraping - Invalid max_pages (exceeds limit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{email}}",
    "website_url": "https://example.com",
    "max_pages": 1000
}

### Start scraping - Invalid max_pages (negative)
POST {{baseUrl}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{email}}",
    "website_url": "https://example.com",
    "max_pages": -1
}

### ==============================================
### Full Workflow Test
### ==============================================

### Step 1: Start scraping
# @name startScraping
POST {{baseUrl}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{email}}",
    "website_url": "https://www.example.com",
    "max_pages": 50
}

### Step 2: Check status (repeat until completed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/status/{{email}}

### Step 3: Get collection info
GET {{baseUrl}}/collection/{{email}}

### Step 4: (Optional) Delete collection
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/collection/{{email}}
